/*
 * ================================================================
 * BRAILLE D.O.T.S. — FIRMWARE v6.1 (Supabase Realtime Mode)
 * File: src/main.cpp
 *
 * v6.2: 5 cells (5x 74HC595 daisy-chained), buttons NEXT=16 BACK=14 ANSWER=13
 *
 * v6.1 changes:
 *   - SAFETY: clearDisplay() now turns ALL coils OFF (was: all ON at 100%)
 *   - SAFETY: chunk "" is now a real kill-switch
 *   - SAFETY: firmware-side 60s timeout (backup if the phone app dies)
 *   - SAFETY: coils drop on WebSocket disconnect / error
 *   - FIX: subscribes to device_commands INSERTs (postgres_changes),
 *          matching how the app actually sends commands
 *
 * Commands arrive via: INSERT into device_commands
 *   row.device_id          = this device's UUID
 *   row.payload.chunk      = "HELLO" (up to 5 letters) or "" (kill-switch)
 *
 * ⚠  UNPLUG GPIO5 (PIN_LATCH) before every upload!
 * ================================================================
 */

